<http://data.silknow.org/object/66e0bcd4-4027-3870-b45f-08526ce1b1de>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The plain linen in this piece is embroidered with punto riccio, punto reale, and punto quadra.  A strip of cut-work with a band of reticella above and below it.  Sewed to the edge of one piece of reticella are points of the same work.  Above the other band of reticella is a piece of linen in which are groups of square openings and embroidery."@en ;
